msgid ""
"| `layerwise_independent_layers` | Layers that keep dedicated buffers. The "
"default is `[0]`; `\"all\"` disables cross-layer reuse. |"
msgstr "| `layerwise_independent_layers` | 保留专用缓冲区的层。默认值为`[0]`；`\"all\"`禁用跨层复用。 |"

msgid "Add the following options to the Decode launch command:"
msgstr "将以下选项添加到 Decode 启动命令中："

msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `topk_buffer_size` | Device hot-buffer size. It must be at least "
"`index_topk` and divisible by `block_size`. Twice `index_topk` is a "
"practical starting point. |"
msgstr ""
"| `topk_buffer_size` | 设备热缓冲区大小。它必须至少为 `index_topk`，并且能被 `block_size` 整除。以 "
"`index_topk` 的两倍作为起点是可行的。 |"

msgid ""
"| `dram_size_per_dp_GB` | Host memory reserved per DP rank. It must hold the"
" full KV cache. TP ranks share this pool. |"
msgstr ""
"| `dram_size_per_dp_GB` | 每个 DP rank 预留的主机内存。它必须能容纳完整的 KV 缓存。TP rank 共享此内存池。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| `keep_device_kv_cache` | Debug-only option that retains the full device KV"
" cache. Keep it `false` in production. |"
msgstr ""
"| `keep_device_kv_cache` | 仅用于调试的选项，用于保留完整的设备 KV 缓存。在生产环境中请保持其为 `false`。 |"

msgid "# Layerwise and Sparse KV Cache Offloading Guide"
msgstr "# 分层与稀疏KV缓存卸载指南"

msgid "This guide explains how to configure:"
msgstr "本指南说明如何配置："

msgid ""
"- Layerwise KV cache offloading during the Prefill phase\n"
"- Sparse KV cache offloading during the Decode phase\n"
"- Combining both features in a disaggregated Prefill/Decode deployment"
msgstr ""
"- 在Prefill阶段进行分层KV缓存卸载\n"
"- 在Decode阶段进行稀疏KV缓存卸载\n"
"- 在分离式Prefill/Decode部署中结合使用这两个功能"

msgid ""
"For the underlying architecture and implementation details, see\n"
"[Layerwise and Sparse KV Cache Offloading Design](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关底层架构和实现细节，请参阅\n"
"[分层与稀疏KV缓存卸载设计](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md)。"

msgid "## Supported Models"
msgstr "## 支持的模型"

msgid ""
"The combined deployment currently supports the following sparse-attention\n"
"model families:"
msgstr "组合部署目前支持以下稀疏注意力模型系列："

msgid ""
"- [GLM-5.1](../../tutorials/models/GLM5.md)\n"
"- [GLM-5.2](../../tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md)\n"
"- [DeepSeek-V3.2](../../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md)"
msgstr ""
"- [GLM-5.1](../../tutorials/models/GLM5.md)\n"
"- [GLM-5.2](../../tutorials/models/GLM5.2.md)\n"
"- [DeepSeek-V3.2](../../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md)"

msgid "Other sparse-attention models have not been validated."
msgstr "其他稀疏注意力模型尚未经过验证。"

msgid "## 1. Install Dependencies"
msgstr "## 1. 安装依赖"

msgid "### Prefill Build Dependencies"
msgstr "### Prefill构建依赖"

msgid "=== \"A3 series\""
msgstr "=== \"A3系列\""

msgid ""
"Prefill requires MemFabric Hybrid and Memcache Hybrid. Install them in this\n"
"    order."
msgstr "Prefill需要MemFabric Hybrid和Memcache Hybrid。请按此顺序安装。"

msgid "#### MemFabric Hybrid"
msgstr "#### MemFabric Hybrid"

msgid ""
"Install MemFabric Hybrid release 1.2 on every Prefill node. This release\n"
"    requires NPU driver `25.5.1` or later."
msgstr "在每个Prefill节点上安装MemFabric Hybrid 1.2版本。该版本需要NPU驱动`25.5.1`或更高版本。"

msgid "#### Memcache Hybrid"
msgstr "#### Memcache Hybrid"

msgid "Install Memcache Hybrid after MemFabric Hybrid:"
msgstr "在MemFabric Hybrid之后安装Memcache Hybrid："

msgid "Configure `mmc-meta.conf`:"
msgstr "配置`mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid "Configure `mmc-local.conf` on every Prefill node:"
msgstr "在每个Prefill节点上配置`mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"The two files must use the same MetaService endpoint. The LocalService\n"
"    Config Store endpoint must match the MetaService Config Store endpoint."
msgstr ""
"这两个文件必须使用相同的MetaService端点。LocalService的Config Store端点必须与MetaService的Config "
"Store端点匹配。"

msgid ""
"- Set `world_size` to the maximum supported LocalService rank count.\n"
"    - Use `device_sdma` with HCCS.\n"
"    - Set `dram.size` to at least the total KV cache size required by the target\n"
"      sequence length and concurrency divided by the number of Prefill ranks.\n"
"      Round the result up to a whole GiB."
msgstr ""
"- 将`world_size`设置为支持的最大LocalService rank数量。\n"
"    - 将`device_sdma`与HCCS配合使用。\n"
"    - 将`dram.size`设置为目标序列长度和并发度所需的KV缓存总大小除以Prefill rank数量后的值，并将结果向上取整到整数GiB。"

msgid ""
"> **Note:** The configuration paths below assume Python 3.11.10. If you use\n"
"    > another Python version, replace the Python installation and\n"
"    > `site-packages` directories with those of the active environment. Locate\n"
"    > its `site-packages` directory with:\n"
"    >\n"
"    > `python -c \"import site; print(site.getsitepackages())\"`"
msgstr ""
"> **注意：** 以下配置路径假定使用Python 3.11.10。如果您使用其他Python版本，请将Python安装目录和`site-packages`目录替换为当前环境对应的目录。可通过以下命令定位其`site-packages`目录：\n"
"    >\n"
"    > `python -c \"import site; print(site.getsitepackages())\"`"

msgid "Start MetaService in a separate process:"
msgstr "在单独进程中启动MetaService："

msgid "Prepare every Prefill node before starting vLLM:"
msgstr "在启动vLLM之前准备每个Prefill节点："

msgid "### Decode Build Dependencies"
msgstr "### Decode构建依赖"

msgid ""
"> **Important:** MemFabric Hybrid release 1.2 must be installed on both\n"
"    > Prefill and Decode nodes. Memcache Hybrid is required only on Prefill."
msgstr ""
"> **重要：** MemFabric Hybrid 1.2版本必须同时安装在Prefill和Decode节点上。Memcache "
"Hybrid仅在Prefill节点上需要。"

msgid ""
"Use the same MemFabric Hybrid build and installation commands shown above.\n"
"    Decode also requires Clang and OpenMP. Prepare every Decode node:"
msgstr "使用上面所示的相同MemFabric Hybrid构建和安装命令。Decode还需要Clang和OpenMP。准备每个Decode节点："

msgid "If Clang or OpenMP is missing:"
msgstr "如果缺少Clang或OpenMP："

msgid ""
"If the image provides a specific Clang version, install the matching OpenMP\n"
"    package, for example `libomp-17-dev` for Clang 17."
msgstr "如果镜像提供了特定版本的Clang，请安装匹配的OpenMP包，例如Clang 17对应`libomp-17-dev`。"

msgid "## 2. Layerwise KV Cache Offload on Prefill"
msgstr "## 2. Prefill上的分层KV缓存卸载"

msgid "Use this mode on a dedicated Prefill node with:"
msgstr "在专用Prefill节点上使用此模式，需满足："

msgid ""
"- `kv_role: \"kv_producer\"`;\n"
"- the Memcache backend;\n"
"- an MLA, SFA, or DSA attention backend; and\n"
"- eager execution."
msgstr ""
"- `kv_role: \"kv_producer\"`；\n"
"- Memcache后端；\n"
"- MLA、SFA或DSA注意力后端；以及\n"
"- eager执行模式。"

msgid ""
"For a combined deployment, Prefill TP must be greater than or equal to Decode\n"
"TP and divisible by it."
msgstr "对于组合部署，Prefill的TP必须大于或等于Decode的TP，并且能够被其整除。"

msgid ""
"Add the following options to the Prefill launch command. `MultiConnector` lets\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` offload layer buffers to Memcache while\n"
"`SfaRemoteD2HConnector` exposes the same buffers to Decode:"
msgstr ""
"在Prefill启动命令中添加以下选项。`MultiConnector`允许`AscendStoreConnector`将层缓冲区卸载到Memcache，同时`SfaRemoteD2HConnector`将相同的缓冲区暴露给Decode："

msgid ""
"Do not set `sparse_kv_offload_config` on Prefill. The\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` entry uses the following buffer options:"
msgstr ""
"不要在Prefill上设置`sparse_kv_offload_config`。`AscendStoreConnector`条目使用以下缓冲区选项："

msgid ""
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | Number of reusable NPU buffers. Start "
"with two to four and tune for memory and transfer bandwidth. |"
msgstr ""
"| `layerwise_num_shared_buffers` | 可复用的NPU缓冲区数量。从两到四个开始，并根据内存和传输带宽进行调整。 |"

msgid "The following log confirms that buffer reuse is enabled:"
msgstr "以下日志确认缓冲区复用已启用："

msgid "## 3. Sparse KV Cache Offload on Decode"
msgstr "## 3. Decode上的稀疏KV缓存卸载"

msgid "Requirements:"
msgstr "要求："

msgid ""
"On Decode, reserve\n"
"`decode_data_parallel_size * decode_tensor_parallel_size` consecutive ports\n"
"starting from `kv_port`."
msgstr ""
"在Decode上，从`kv_port`开始预留\n"
"`decode_data_parallel_size * decode_tensor_parallel_size`个连续端口。"

msgid "## 4. Start the P/D Proxy"
msgstr "## 4. 启动P/D代理"

msgid ""
"Start Prefill and Decode with the configurations above. After both nodes are\n"
"ready, start the proxy:"
msgstr "使用上述配置启动Prefill和Decode。两个节点都就绪后，启动代理："

msgid ""
"For multi-node deployment, advertise reachable addresses instead of\n"
"`0.0.0.0`. Send inference requests to the proxy port (`9000` in this example)."
msgstr "对于多节点部署，请通告可访问的地址，而不是`0.0.0.0`。将推理请求发送到代理端口（本例中为`9000`）。"

msgid "## 5. Limitations"
msgstr "## 5. 限制"

msgid "The `SfaRemoteD2HConnector` entry accepts the following options:"
msgstr "`SfaRemoteD2HConnector`条目接受以下选项："

msgid ""
"| `transfer_backend` | Transfer backend. `memfabric` is the only supported "
"value. |"
msgstr "| `transfer_backend` | 传输后端。`memfabric`是唯一支持的值。 |"

msgid ""
"The installation steps are grouped by hardware. A3 and 950PR&950DT Products are supported.\n"
"On 950PR&950DT Products nodes, set the MemFabric transfer protocol to `device_urma` as described\n"
"in sections 2 and 3."
msgstr ""
"安装步骤按硬件分组。支持 Atlas A3系列产品和 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。\n"
"在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品节点上，按照第 2 节和第 3 节所述，\n"
"将 MemFabric 传输协议设置为 `device_urma`。"

msgid ""
"| `memfabric_transfer_protocol` | MemFabric data-path protocol: `sdma` "
"(default) and `device_rdma` for A3 series, `device_urma` for 950PR&950DT "
"Products. Must be set to the same value on Prefill and Decode. Invalid "
"values abort startup. |"
msgstr ""
"| `memfabric_transfer_protocol` | MemFabric 数据通路协议：A3 系列使用 `sdma`（默认）和 "
"`device_rdma`，Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品使用 `device_urma`。Prefill 和 Decode "
"上必须设置为相同的值。无效值会导致启动中止。 |"

msgid ""
"On 950PR&950DT Products nodes, add `\"memfabric_transfer_protocol\": \"device_urma\"` to\n"
"`kv_connector_extra_config` on both Prefill and Decode."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品节点上，在 Prefill 和 Decode 的\n"
"`kv_connector_extra_config` 中添加 `\"memfabric_transfer_protocol\": \"device_urma\"`。"

msgid "### Optional Fused Copy-SFA Operators"
msgstr "### 可选的融合 Copy-SFA 算子"

msgid ""
"With `sparse_kv_offload_config.fused_op_type=\"fused_copy_sfa\"`, the Python integration requires\n"
"these operators in the installed `_C_ascend` extension:"
msgstr ""
"当设置 `sparse_kv_offload_config.fused_op_type=\"fused_copy_sfa\"` 时，Python "
"集成需要已安装的 `_C_ascend` 扩展中包含以下算子："

msgid ""
"- `npu_fused_lightning_indexer_manage`\n"
"- `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage` (LIM C8)\n"
"- `npu_fused_scatter_copy_sparse_flash_attention`"
msgstr ""
"- `npu_fused_lightning_indexer_manage`\n"
"- `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage` (LIM C8)\n"
"- `npu_fused_scatter_copy_sparse_flash_attention`"

msgid ""
"The expected interfaces are from\n"
"[vLLM-Ascend PR #16640](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16640),\n"
"revision `a9823977149172f1604d9f2a1937224d0b11646e`. This branch carries the\n"
"Python integration; it does not bundle these native kernels or their bindings.\n"
"An operator-enabled native build is required to run the fused_copy_sfa path."
msgstr ""
"预期接口来自\n"
"[vLLM-Ascend PR #16640](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/16640)，\n"
"版本 `a9823977149172f1604d9f2a1937224d0b11646e`。该分支包含\n"
"Python 集成；它不包含这些原生内核及其绑定。\n"
"运行 fused_copy_sfa 路径需要启用算子的原生构建。"

msgid ""
"LIM C8 uses `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`, which is included on\n"
"this branch. Enable it with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`. The\n"
"indexer then Hadamard-rotates and int8-quantizes query and key, and\n"
"`_lim_select` forwards that int8 query and the fp16 dequant scales to the C8\n"
"LIM. The 19-parameter management ABI matches BF16 LIM, so Copy-SFA and miss H2D\n"
"stay unchanged. The C8 kernel is int8-only; `indexer_kv_dtype fp8` is not a\n"
"LIM C8 serving path."
msgstr ""
"LIM C8 使用 `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`，该算子已包含在\n"
"此分支中。通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` 启用它。\n"
"此时 indexer 会对 query 和 key 进行 Hadamard 旋转和 int8 量化，\n"
"`_lim_select` 会将该 int8 query 和 fp16 反量化 scale 转发给 C8\n"
"LIM。19 参数管理 ABI 与 BF16 LIM 一致，因此 Copy-SFA 和 miss H2D\n"
"保持不变。C8 内核仅支持 int8；`indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 不是\n"
"LIM C8 的服务路径。"

msgid ""
"Copy-SFA receives `dram_k_rope` and `dram_kv_cache` as CPU tensor views backed\n"
"by registered MemFabric memory. Its native adapter must permit those CPU views;\n"
"the referenced PR revision needs this device-check adjustment. The remaining\n"
"inputs stay on NPU. Ordinary CPU allocations are not valid replacements for\n"
"registered DRAM, and the Python integration does not move the host cache to NPU."
msgstr ""
"Copy-SFA 接收 `dram_k_rope` 和 `dram_kv_cache` 作为由已注册的 MemFabric 内存\n"
"支撑的 CPU tensor 视图。其原生适配器必须允许这些 CPU 视图；\n"
"所引用的 PR 版本需要此设备检查调整。其余\n"
"输入保持在 NPU 上。普通 CPU 分配不能替代\n"
"已注册的 DRAM，并且 Python 集成不会将主机缓存移动到 NPU。"

msgid ""
"For launch settings, see [Enable Fused LIM and Copy-SFA](#enable-fused-lim-"
"and-copy-sfa)."
msgstr "有关启动设置，请参阅[启用融合 LIM 和 Copy-SFA](#enable-fused-lim-and-copy-sfa)。"

msgid ""
"- use disaggregated Prefill/Decode deployment;\n"
"- enable the feature only on Decode; and\n"
"- use Model Runner V1 or V2 on Decode. Keep Decode at pipeline parallel size 1;\n"
"  Prefill can use pipeline parallelism with the producer connector."
msgstr ""
"- 使用分离式 Prefill/Decode 部署；\n"
"- 仅在 Decode 上启用该特性；以及\n"
"- 在 Decode 上使用 Model Runner V1 或 V2。保持 Decode 的流水线并行大小为 1；\n"
"  Prefill 可以使用流水线并行配合生产者连接器。"

msgid ""
"MemFabric configuration-store ownership stays on Prefill, using the official\n"
"transfer-engine initialization. No additional store-role or preconnection\n"
"configuration is needed. Deploy the same connector protocol version on both\n"
"sides, and validate actual remote KV reads rather than relying on `/health`."
msgstr ""
"MemFabric 配置存储的所有权保留在 Prefill 上，使用官方的\n"
"transfer-engine 初始化。无需额外的存储角色或预连接\n"
"配置。在两侧部署相同的连接器协议版本，\n"
"并验证实际的远程 KV 读取，而不是依赖 `/health`。"

msgid ""
"For the validated GLM-5.2 Prefill PP2 deployment on 16 NPUs, use DP1 × PP2 ×\n"
"TP8, not DP2 × PP2 × TP8. Set `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=38,40`: each stage\n"
"must contain the full Indexer owner for its shared Indexer layers. A balanced\n"
"39/39 partition is rejected by the existing stage-boundary guard; cross-stage\n"
"TopK sharing is not supported. Decode remains DP2 × TP8 with PP size 1."
msgstr ""
"对于在 16 个 NPU 上经过验证的 GLM-5.2 Prefill PP2 部署，请使用 DP1 × PP2 ×\n"
"TP8，而不是 DP2 × PP2 × TP8。设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=38,40`：每个 stage\n"
"必须包含其共享 Indexer 层的完整 Indexer 所有者。均衡的\n"
"39/39 分区会被现有的 stage 边界保护拒绝；不支持跨 stage\n"
"的 TopK 共享。Decode 保持 DP2 × TP8，PP 大小为 1。"

msgid ""
"| `fused_op_type` | Set to `\"fused_copy_sfa\"` to enable fused LIM and "
"Copy-SFA together. The default, `\"none\"`, uses the existing sparse offload"
" path. |"
msgstr ""
"| `fused_op_type` | 设置为 `\"fused_copy_sfa\"` 以同时启用融合 LIM 和 Copy-SFA。默认值 "
"`\"none\"` 使用现有的稀疏卸载路径。 |"

msgid "### Enable Fused LIM and Copy-SFA"
msgstr "### 启用融合 LIM 和 Copy-SFA"

msgid ""
"After installing the [optional native operators](#optional-fused-copy-sfa-operators),\n"
"set the following fields in the Decode node's `--additional-config`. This\n"
"example supports MTP3:"
msgstr ""
"在安装[可选的原生算子](#optional-fused-copy-sfa-operators)后，\n"
"在 Decode 节点的 `--additional-config` 中设置以下字段。此\n"
"示例支持 MTP3："

msgid ""
"Merge this object with any existing additional settings and pass\n"
"`--additional-config` once. Keep the Prefill configuration from section 2;\n"
"enable these fused operators only on Decode in a PD deployment."
msgstr ""
"将此对象与任何现有的附加设置合并，并只传递一次\n"
"`--additional-config`。保留第 2 节中的 Prefill 配置；\n"
"在 PD 部署中仅在 Decode 上启用这些融合算子。"

msgid "The fused path has these additional requirements:"
msgstr "融合路径有以下附加要求："

msgid ""
"- The model must use `index_topk=2048` and a cache block size of `128`.\n"
"- Let `Q_max = 1 + num_speculative_tokens`, or `1` without speculative decoding.\n"
"  `Q_max` must be between `1` and `14`.\n"
"- `topk_buffer_size` must be a multiple of `256`, at least `Q_max * 2048`,\n"
"  and at most `32512` (the largest aligned value within LIM's `32640` limit).\n"
"  The runtime allocates two additional tail blocks;\n"
"  do not add them to this setting.\n"
"- Keep `use_fused_overlap=false`; it cannot be combined with `fused_copy_sfa`.\n"
"- Use BF16 for the main KV cache. Sparse SFA C8 is not supported.\n"
"  Sparse LI C8 serving is supported for the device-resident indexer:\n"
"  add `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` so fused Copy-SFA\n"
"  selects `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`."
msgstr ""
"- 模型必须使用 `index_topk=2048` 和 `128` 的缓存块大小。\n"
"- 令 `Q_max = 1 + num_speculative_tokens`，如果没有投机解码则为 `1`。\n"
"  `Q_max` 必须在 `1` 到 `14` 之间。\n"
"- `topk_buffer_size` 必须是 `256` 的倍数，至少为 `Q_max * 2048`，\n"
"  至多为 `32512`（LIM 的 `32640` 限制内的最大对齐值）。\n"
"  运行时会额外分配两个尾部块；\n"
"  不要将它们加入此设置。\n"
"- 保持 `use_fused_overlap=false`；它不能与 `fused_copy_sfa` 组合使用。\n"
"- 主 KV 缓存使用 BF16。不支持稀疏 SFA C8。\n"
"  对于设备驻留的 indexer，支持稀疏 LI C8 服务：\n"
"  添加 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`，使融合 Copy-SFA\n"
"  选择 `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`。"

msgid "| Draft tokens | `Q_max` | Minimum `topk_buffer_size` |"
msgstr "| Draft tokens | `Q_max` | 最小 `topk_buffer_size` |"

msgid ""
"For example, the following A3 Decode command uses GLM-5.2 W4A8 with DP2 TP8,\n"
"MTP3, and `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` target graphs. Replace the model path and size\n"
"the model length, concurrency and host-cache budget for your deployment.\n"
"The command assumes the dependency environment from section 1 is already set."
msgstr ""
"例如，以下 A3 Decode 命令使用 GLM-5.2 W4A8，配置为 DP2 TP8、\n"
"MTP3 和 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 目标图。请替换模型路径，并根据你的部署\n"
"调整模型长度、并发数和主机缓存预算。\n"
"该命令假设第 1 节中的依赖环境已设置好。"

msgid ""
"Here, `enforce_eager` applies only to the MTP draft model. The target uses the\n"
"graph mode configured by `--compilation-config`; do not add a top-level\n"
"`--enforce-eager` when using this graph example. Decode prefix caching is\n"
"disabled, and `keep_device_kv_cache=false` keeps the full main KV in the host\n"
"pool. With DP2, the example reserves `2 * 128 = 256` GiB of host KV memory."
msgstr ""
"此处 `enforce_eager` 仅适用于 MTP draft 模型。目标模型使用\n"
"由 `--compilation-config` 配置的图模式；使用此图示例时不要添加顶层\n"
"`--enforce-eager`。Decode 前缀缓存已\n"
"禁用，`keep_device_kv_cache=false` 将完整的主 KV 保留在主机\n"
"池中。在 DP2 下，该示例预留 `2 * 128 = 256` GiB 的主机 KV 内存。"

msgid ""
"Model Runner V2 uses the same sparse-offload configuration, including MTP and\n"
"`fused_copy_sfa`: set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`. For an eager V2 launch,\n"
"replace the graph compilation option with a top-level `--enforce-eager`."
msgstr ""
"Model Runner V2 使用相同的稀疏卸载配置，包括 MTP 和\n"
"`fused_copy_sfa`：设置 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`。对于 eager V2 启动，\n"
"将图编译选项替换为顶层 `--enforce-eager`。"

msgid "### DSpark with Sparse Decode Offload"
msgstr "### DSpark 配合稀疏 Decode 卸载"

msgid ""
"GLM MLA DSpark requires Model Runner V2 on both Prefill and Decode. Configure\n"
"the same draft checkpoint and speculative-token count on both nodes, for example:"
msgstr ""
"GLM MLA DSpark 要求在 Prefill 和 Decode 上都使用 Model Runner V2。在两个节点上\n"
"配置相同的 draft checkpoint 和投机 token 数量，例如："

msgid ""
"Keep Prefill eager and disable local vLLM prefix caching on both nodes. Auxiliary capture\n"
"layers are resolved from the draft checkpoint; no separate layer-ID setting is\n"
"needed. Prefill projects the target's prompt features locally and writes its\n"
"own draft KV. The SFA producer connector transfers those pages alongside target\n"
"KV, and Decode waits for both transfers before decoding. Hidden features are\n"
"not sent to Decode for prompt-KV reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"保持 Prefill 为 eager 模式，并在两个节点上禁用本地 vLLM 前缀缓存。辅助捕获层从草稿检查点解析，无需单独设置层 ID。Prefill"
" 在本地投影目标的 prompt 特征，并写入自己的草稿 KV。SFA producer 连接器将这些页与目标 KV 一起传输，Decode "
"在解码前等待两个传输完成。隐藏特征不会发送到 Decode 用于 prompt-KV 重建。"

msgid ""
"The Prefill Memcache layerwise store can reuse external prefixes independently\n"
"of the local prefix-caching switch. It saves draft KV under checkpoint-specific\n"
"companion keys, without placing the live draft pages in target scratch buffers.\n"
"A prefix is usable only when every target stage and every final-stage draft TP\n"
"rank has saved it. Prefill restores draft pages into the new request's NPU block\n"
"table, projects only the remaining prompt features, then transfers the completed\n"
"target and draft KV to Decode. The final Eagle recomputation block is retained\n"
"even on a complete store hit. Missing draft companions make the prefix a miss;\n"
"load failures after lookup fail closed rather than using uninitialized draft KV."
msgstr ""
"Prefill Memcache 分层存储可以独立于本地前缀缓存开关复用外部前缀。它使用检查点特定的伴随键保存草稿 "
"KV，而不将活跃的草稿页放入目标暂存缓冲区。只有当每个目标阶段和每个最终阶段草稿 TP rank 都已保存该前缀时，该前缀才可用。Prefill "
"将草稿页恢复到新请求的 NPU 块表中，仅投影剩余的 prompt 特征，然后将完成的目标和草稿 KV 传输到 "
"Decode。即使完全命中存储，也会保留最终的 Eagle "
"重计算块。缺少草稿伴随项会使前缀未命中；查找后的加载失败会以失败关闭方式处理，而不是使用未初始化的草稿 KV。"

msgid ""
"Enable sparse offload only on Decode, with the consumer connector and\n"
"`fused_copy_sfa` configuration above. For draft8, set `topk_buffer_size` to at\n"
"least `18432`; `20480` is an example with extra hot-cache capacity. These are\n"
"kernel/layout bounds, not a draft-checkpoint whitelist or a guarantee that every\n"
"width has been validated end to end. Both nodes must use the same cache block\n"
"size. Remote DSpark draft-KV transfer does not support PCP or DCP."
msgstr ""
"仅在 Decode 上启用稀疏卸载，并使用上述 consumer 连接器和 `fused_copy_sfa` 配置。对于 draft8，将 "
"`topk_buffer_size` 设置为至少 `18432`；`20480` "
"是一个具有额外热缓存容量的示例。这些是内核/布局边界，不是草稿检查点白名单，也不保证每个宽度都已端到端验证。两个节点必须使用相同的缓存块大小。远程 "
"DSpark 草稿 KV 传输不支持 PCP 或 DCP。"

msgid ""
"Only the target's main KV is offloaded to the host. The loaded draft supplies\n"
"its cache-layer ownership, and its full context KV stays in device memory.\n"
"Layerwise Prefill Offload excludes draft pages from its shared scratch pool.\n"
"The paired prefix-store path also keeps draft save/load separate from target\n"
"layer hooks, including when target buffers are not reused. Other store paths\n"
"retain their original registration and addressing.\n"
"Account for this context-dependent HBM cost when sizing long-context serving;\n"
"target offload alone does not establish 1M-context DSpark support."
msgstr ""
"只有目标的主 KV 被卸载到主机。加载的草稿提供其缓存层所有权，其完整上下文 KV 保留在设备内存中。分层 Prefill "
"卸载将草稿页排除在其共享暂存池之外。配对的 prefix-store "
"路径还将草稿保存/加载与目标层钩子分开，包括目标缓冲区未被复用时。其他存储路径保留其原始注册和寻址。在为长上下文服务进行容量规划时，请考虑这种依赖于上下文的"
" HBM 成本；仅目标卸载并不能建立 1M 上下文 DSpark 支持。"

msgid ""
"- Shared-buffer Layerwise Prefill Offload requires Memcache and eager mode.\n"
"- Context parallelism has not been validated with Layerwise Prefill Offload.\n"
"- Sparse Decode Offload supports DP and TP on Decode; CP and Decode-side PP\n"
"  are not supported. Prefill-side PP is supported with the producer connector.\n"
"- MemFabric is the only supported `SfaRemoteD2HConnector` transfer backend.\n"
"- The MemFabric data-path protocol is selected by launch configuration instead\n"
"  of hardware detection: use `sdma` (default) or `device_rdma` on A3 series and\n"
"  `device_urma` on 950PR&950DT Products, identically on Prefill and Decode.\n"
"- Layerwise buffer reuse cannot currently be combined with\n"
"  `MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` because per-buffer transfer completion gating is\n"
"  not yet implemented. Support is planned in a follow-up update."
msgstr ""
"- 共享缓冲区分层 Prefill 卸载需要 Memcache 和 eager 模式。\n"
"- 上下文并行尚未与分层 Prefill 卸载一起验证。\n"
"- 稀疏 Decode 卸载在 Decode 上支持 DP 和 TP；不支持 CP 和 Decode 侧 PP。Prefill 侧 PP 在 producer 连接器下受支持。\n"
"- MemFabric 是唯一受支持的 `SfaRemoteD2HConnector` 传输后端。\n"
"- MemFabric 数据路径协议由启动配置选择，而不是硬件检测：在 A3 系列上使用 `sdma`（默认）或 `device_rdma`，在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上使用 `device_urma`，在 Prefill 和 Decode 上保持一致。\n"
"- 分层缓冲区复用目前无法与 `MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` 结合使用，因为每个缓冲区的传输完成门控尚未实现。支持计划在后续更新中提供。"
